msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:12
#: 3b1a29470b3a4c60b2eb287d20460387
msgid "The `MAVLink Manual Control protocol <https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__, which includes axis commands and button states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:14
#: 1326cbb767034ca58d9588b7d418ba54
msgid "For `legacy reasons <https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/issues/8818>`__, ArduSub's `MANUAL_CONTROL <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MANUAL_CONTROL>`__ support expects Z-axis values in range [0,1000], instead of the specification range [-1000,1000]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:16
